      "statement": "The two process entrypoints are the Click CLI `bosshunter` (resolving to `bosshunter.main:cli`) and the Bottle backend `bosshunter-server` (resolving to `bosshunter.backend:main`, also runnable as `python -m bosshunter`), and both load one configuration and configure the browser runtime before invoking domain services.",
