      "id": "claim_8b39699c2de1488381df4ec199366058",
      "statement": "Application runs require a PostgreSQL `database.url`; `get_db()` fails fast without one, while `get_business_db()` gives the web API and assistant a single shared connection source, and `PostgresConnection` adapts SQLite SQL to psycopg.",
