    {
      "id": "claim_f200fd57ce3145679a8c0b7a6ced1fa9",
      "statement": "The job state machine is `pending → filtered` or `pending → scored → ready → approved → sent`, with `replied`/`needs_resume`/`follow_up_sent` branches and an `error → approved` retry recovery that never bypasses confirmation.",
